EFFECTIVE INT (BIG NUM MATH 2)

- add bitshift operations
- add stein + extended stein gcds
- add modular inversion gcd


short description
- effective integer data type — holding numbers in series of words instead of byte series, e.g. assuming word size 64 bit, 4 words wide effective integer is effectively 'Int256' data type
